{"id": "DeeRKS9R-7I", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "What happened the day the SUN went out? ☀️🌑 Who saved the world from the cold and the dark?\n\nMali and Sumali, two rakshasa brothers, were great devotees of Shiva. Surya, the sun god, burned them to ashes. Shiva\nwas furious: he hurled his trishul at the sun, and Surya fell unconscious. The world went dark. Rivers froze. Flowers\ndied.\n\nSurya's father, Kashyapa, cursed Shiva: \"One day, your son will lose his head.\" 🐘 That is why Ganesha has an elephant\nhead! (Brahma Vaivarta Purana)\n\nThe world needed a new sun, and Shiva turned to ONE goddess. Who did he ask to become the sun? 🔥\nFind out in Book 4 of our Navadurga series, launching 16 October (₹200).\nBooks 1–3 are out now: the set of 3 for ₹500. Order at rishikatha.com (link in bio) 📚\n\nComment your guess before you watch the end! 👇 Save this, and share it with someone who loves Shiva's stories. 🙏\n\n#suryadev #shiva #mahadev #ganesha #kushmanda #navadurga #navratri #maadurga #hindumythology #sanatandharma #puranas #mythologystories #indianmythology #kidsbooks #rishikatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1791977101, "like_count": 7576, "comment_count": 73, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2449898875536681a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.098, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQM12WW6TLV5RemZYxb6gOBi0nMJ_psiGKU8V9gHtMdrsbElHD-FQyS-reiQiGOuTvlZE4-fSw6Kwm66cfLk0yJUlJZuW8ocQc8Imt8.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=AdorMq7_ehowinE7VCjKv7MYUuDCiePw4VmmrMbHGt-RaczwcIAM8dqYNTaFMsQAPP7nkap8_W5Kn9nMXY20pLcA&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=oLCz9Jn1nKQQ7kNvwGij7Rp&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=3VI1I_0YrCLzic2RI-jdPw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQvUSKyd